            "block_content": "20-2.2. Teaching periods will be spread out over the eight-period day so that, with the exception of teachers of double-period subjects, a teacher will normally teach no more than two periods consecutively. In all instances, efficient utilization of the school facilities and personnel must be accorded the highest priority to ensure proper scheduling.",
